      "observed": "C2 is listed with value \"100m\", while the other bulk servo-rail capacitors C1, C3, and C4 are listed as \"100u\". The SPICE deck also models C2 as 100m.",
      "expected": "The specification requires C1–C4 to be 100 µF bulk capacitors on the servo power rail, so C2 should be \"100u\" or an equivalent 100 µF value.",
