        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"C2\") (value \"100m\") (footprint \"Capacitor_SMD:C_1206_3216Metric_Pad1.33x1.80mm_HandSolder\") (fields (field (name \"LCSC\") \"C15008\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "C1–C4 | 100 µF × 4 | Bulk capacitance on the servo power rail"
        },
        {
          "source": "spice",
          "quote": "C2 0 Net-_D2-K_ 100m"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "This creates a mismatch between the intended 100 µF servo-rail decoupling/bulk capacitance and the schematic/BOM value. If assembled according to the value field, C2 could be sourced or populated as 100 mF rather than 100 µF, changing the servo power rail buffering and inrush behavior.",
      "confidence": 0.93
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The board's connectivity mostly matches the specification, but C2 has an anomalous value of 100m instead of the intended 100u used by C1, C3, and C4 on the servo power rail."
}

